<title>UK: Abbey National prices 250 mln stg August 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Abbey National prices 250 mln stg August 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abbey National Treasury Services Plc has priced a 250 million stg tranche of its 6.00 percent Eurobond due August 1999, lead manager Salomon Brothers International said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal is guaranteed by Abbey National Plc.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT   *250 MLN STG   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    10.AUG.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.057    PAY DATE    07.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.20	REOFFER    98.057    SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LON/SI/HK PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/HK/SI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT GILT DUE AUG.99</p>
<p> NOTES     *ADD-ON TO EXISTING 500 MILLION STG ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
